{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590790/extras/spr_UIStoryBanner.png?t=1743279097\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>On a fog-covered night, Adrian\u2019s car breaks down on a desolate road. Searching for help, he finds a looming mansion and steps inside\u2014only for the door to lock behind him. With no way out, he must navigate its dark corridors, piece together its buried secrets, and survive the horrors that now stalk him in the shadows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590790/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1743279097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by &quot;Resident Evil&quot; and &quot;Alan Wake&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590790/extras/spr_UIGameplayBanner.png?t=1743279097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590790/extras/Gifmaker-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1743279097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the mansion's decaying halls, uncover hidden pathways, and piece together the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590790/extras/Gifmaker2-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1743279097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive against the horrors that lurk in the dark. Manage your limited ammo, choose your battles wisely, and make every shot count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590790/extras/Gifmaker3-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1743279097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe your surroundings, uncover hidden clues, and find a way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590790/extras/spr_UIFeaturesBanner.png?t=1743279097\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric 2.5D pixel art</strong> that sets a haunting tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tense survival horror combat</strong> with scarce resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A flashlight that reveals more than just the dark.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging puzzles</strong> woven into the mansion\u2019s secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scavenge, craft, and survive</strong> against overwhelming odds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A chilling story</strong> told through exploration and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unravel the mystery</strong> and face what lurks within.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Be very afraid of SPIDERS!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590790/extras/Gifmaker4-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1743279097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590790?t=1743279097","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590790?t=1743279097","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590790/04af434537a0a3588b3c2778be0bf10372b9ea63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743279097","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590790/04af434537a0a3588b3c2778be0bf10372b9ea63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743279097","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":nu